title Owner approves a vendor closeout (as built @ b45b1ac, lib/actions/closeout-submissions.ts:116-237)

Owner [icon: user]
Web [icon: monitor]
Action [label: reviewCloseoutSubmissionAction, icon: server]
DB [label: Neon Postgres (neon-http, no transactions), icon: database]
Email [label: Resend, icon: mail]

Owner > Web: Click "Approve closeout"
Web > Action: server action (requestId, closeoutId, "approved", reviewNotes)
Action > DB: SELECT request (owner check)
Action > DB: SELECT closeout (belongs to request?)
alt [label: not owner / closeout not found] {
  Action --> Web: { error }
}
else [label: authorized] {
  Action > DB: UPDATE closeout_submissions SET status = approved   (write 1)
  Action > DB: UPDATE requests SET final_cost, status = Complete   (write 2)
  Action > DB: UPDATE request_tasks SET accepted_at WHERE done    (write 3)
  Action > DB: SELECT billing_records by closeout_submission_id
  Action > DB: INSERT billing_records                              (write 4)
  Action > DB: INSERT decision_log closeout_approved               (write 5)
  alt [label: any write 2..5 fails (network, cold start, constraint)] {
    Action --> Web: thrown error, generic Next.js error screen (no error.tsx)
    DB --> DB: earlier writes stay committed, record is half-applied (F5)
  }
  else [label: all writes succeed] {
    Action > Email: notify vendor (failure is logged, never thrown)
    Action --> Web: { ok: true, decision: approved }
  }
}
